brain_agent_system.response_format:
Return one JSON object with:
{
  "thoughts": "private concise routing analysis",
  "progress_update": "short public status",
  "route": "task" or "rp",
  "task_description": "short concrete objective, or empty for rp",
  "task_system_prompt": "detailed execution strategy, or empty for rp",
  "task_action": "start", "inject", or "cancel_and_start",
  "goal_action": { "action": "optional goal action", "goal": "goal name", "autonomous": true }
}
